    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "今天是星期天，我没有课。",
      "traditional": "今天是星期天，我沒有課。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān shì xīng qī tiān wǒ méi yǒu kè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "早上，我吃了早餐，游了泳。",
      "traditional": "早上，我吃了早餐，游了泳。",
      "pinyin": "zǎo shang wǒ chī le zǎo cān yóu le yǒng",
      "english": "Today is Sunday. I don’t have any classes."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "下午，我打扫了房间，我把我的房间打扫得干干净净。",
      "traditional": "下午，我打掃了房間，我把我的房間打掃得乾乾淨淨。",
      "pinyin": "xià wǔ wǒ dǎ sǎo le fáng jiān wǒ bǎ wǒ de fáng jiān dǎ sǎo de gān gān jìng jìng",
      "english": "In the morning, I had breakfast and went for a swim."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "晚上，我和朋友去吃了烤鸭。",
      "traditional": "晚上，我和朋友去吃了烤鴨。",
      "pinyin": "wǎn shang wǒ hé péng you qù chī le kǎo yā",
      "english": "In the afternoon I cleaned my room, and swept the entire room squeaky clean."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "我没吃过烤鸭，我觉得很好吃。",
      "traditional": "我沒吃過烤鴨，我覺得很好吃。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ méi chī guò kǎo yā wǒ jué de hěn hǎo chī",
      "english": "In the evening, I went with a friend to eat Peking Duck."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I haven’t had Peking Duck before. I think it was delicious."
    }
  ],
